[version]
1.3.6
[date]
2026-10-21
[whatsnew]
- Updater now uses delete-then-download strategy:
  * Downloads new content into memory first
  * Only if download succeeds, deletes old file
  * Then writes new content
  * This prevents stale data leaking into shorter new files
  * Old file is preserved if download fails (no data loss)
- Better abort messaging:
  * Shows how many files were updated vs failed
  * Warns about partial-update state
  * Suggests 'cleanup --force' and 'cp -r /backup/archos-*/* /'
    to restore if needed
[/whatsnew]
[files]
sbin/updater.lua
latest_update.upd
[/files]
